          "eligibilityDescription_md": "\n   1. A registered milk cooperative society located in the tribal areas of Gujarat shall be eligible under this scheme.\n   1. The society must extensively use electricity for milk collection, cooling, and processing.\n   1. The society must be willing to install a solar power plant with a capacity between 1KW and 40KW.\n\n"
