          "benefits_md": "\n  - **Financial Assistance:** 75% subsidy on capital cost for installation of solar systems ranging from 1KW to 40KW.\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n",
          "briefDescription": "The scheme aims to promote renewable energy and reduce electricity expenses. Through this scheme, a 75% subsidy is provided for setting up solar plants (1KW to 40KW) in milk cooperative societies in tribal areas.",
          "detailedDescription": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The \"Scheme of Capital Assistance for Setting Up Solar Plants in Milk Cooperative Societies in the State of Gujarat (Tribal Areas)\" by the Department of Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation, Government of Gujarat aims to promote renewable energy and reduce electricity expenses. Through this scheme, a 75% subsidy is provided for setting up solar plants (1KW to 40KW) in milk cooperative societies in tribal areas."
